msgid ""
"A backup of the noid database is always better than a rebuild: the arks of "
"the resources removed after the last ark stored in Omeka cannot be known, so "
"they may be assigned again to new resources. To avoid it, the rebuild can "
"skip a margin of identifiers after the last ark: they will never be "
"assigned. The only cost is a gap in the numbering."
msgstr ""

